Licence: not yet chosen

The repo owner has not chosen a licence for this project. Until the owner chooses one, the
placeholder in LICENSE applies: all rights reserved, and no permission is granted to use, copy,
modify or distribute this software.

What the choice has to take into account:

- The licences of what ships to the browser, listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md: the web app's
  production dependencies, and the statement engine runtime (Pyodide, the CPython standard
  library, numpy, pandas, python-dateutil, six and pdf.js). Some of these require their notices
  to travel with the app, and some are file-level copyleft.
- Whether others may run their own copy of the app, change it, or only read the code.

When the owner has chosen: replace LICENSE with the chosen licence's text, set `license` in
pyproject.toml and web/package.json, record the decision in docs/decisions/, and delete this file.
